BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Docking with collisions</h1>
Pairs of delta-gliders in orbit, nose to nose: closing at 0.2 m/s with
their docking ports lined up (they must dock), at 1.5 m/s (too fast: they
must collide and not dock) and at 0.2 m/s turned by 25 degrees about the
docking axis (misaligned: they must not dock).
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/DockingTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship A1
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET A1
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

